      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW CORNELIUS (3) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from four tries. Hit the frame latest (30.46) when second at this track in a Mix 3/4. Looks suited here and rates on top. WRONGLY ACCUSED (4) goes very well at this course having never missed the frame including two wins and two placings. Was out of placings last time (30.92) at Angle Park in a OPEN, finishing fourth and beaten 8 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. ASTON MACHINE (1) was game in defeat off a low draw at the latest outing, finishing second and beaten one length (29.64) behind Happy Dad at Sandown. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from four starts. Bold showing expected. PAW GORDY (8) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
